w White, the quiet and mysterious bookworm!<br>-Wizard, the dependable student council president!<br>-And lastly... the boy of my dreams, Alice!<br>They're all handsome and special in their own ways. So who should I spend my school days chasing? It's gonna be so much fun... I can't wait!<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1861230/extras/71f6dc1cd6dff8315a43ea4835aeaa04.webp?t=1726541462\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1861230/extras/b76df734c818fc14d7cbd7a288002cb7.avif?t=1726541462\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1861230/extras/ee979f73eb2973929ca03356c9c7a117.avif?t=1726541462\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1861230/extras/49a6a83bebf5dabbcb78a958158bd2a4.avif?t=1726541462\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1861230/extras/228138569c51f73b77cd9221202a5e14.avif?t=1726541462\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1861230/extras/dc5844b1554897efe2375f15aaf9067a.avif?t=1726541462\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1861230/extras/8649e78444531066d4c260f792e49a16.avif?t=1726541462\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1861230/extras/8ca19450fb14eae0373212ffbacba23d.avif?t=1726541462\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/